--- !u!114 &114658901550537628
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1977429715535914}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 231c31a562fa0695a3ebd8fada9adc68, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  textSound: snd_txtsans
  fontName: sans
  greetMessage: '*\theya.^10\n*\thow can i help\n\tya?'
  idleMessage: '*\tnot really doing\n\tanything else.'
  exitMessage: wink`*\tsee ya later.
  buyGreet: whaddya \nwant?
  buySuccess: wink`thanks.
  buyReject: neutral`ya don't \nwant that?
  buyNoMoney: side`you don't \nhave the \nmoney.
  buyNoSpace: neutral`you're \ncarrying \ntoo much \nstuff.
  item1ID: 21
  item1price: 40
  item1ShortDesc: A BASH-type\nbat item.
  item2ID: 19
  item2price: 25
  item2ShortDesc: Safety first!
  item3ID: 22
  item3price: 15
  item3ShortDesc: Increases\nSPEED in and\nout of battles
  item4ID: 23
  item4price: 30
  item4ShortDesc: From a local\nburger joint
  sellPrompt:
  - neutral`*\they,^05 i'm trying to get rid of\n\tstuff,^05 not get more.
  - wink`*\tmaybe if we get back to the\n\tunderground,^05 we can see if my\n\tbrother wants anything.
  talkGreet: wink`i can tell \nyou about \nshopping \nstuff.
  topic1: About yourself
  topic1lines:
  - wink`*\they,^05 i don't think i asked\n\twhat your name was.
  - closed`*\t...^10 kris,^05 huh.
  - neutral`*\tthat's cool.
  - wink`*\ti'm sans.^10\n*\tsans the skeleton.
  - closed`*\tbut you already knew that.
  - closed`*\tand because you already\n\tknew that,^05 i'm gonna tell you\n\tsomething that you <color=#FFFF00FF>don't know</color>.
  - closed`*\t...
  - side`*\tactually wait a sec,^05 we only\n\tjust met like 20 minutes ago.
  - wink`*\tdon't you know that friendship\n\ttakes time?
  - neutral`*\tbesides,^05 don't you have\n\tanything <color=#FFFF00FF>more important</color> to do?
  topic2: About shop
  topic2lines:
  - rolleye`*\twell,^05 i found a buncha\n\tstuff when i fell,^05 and i don't\n\thave any use for it.
  - wink`*\tso hey,^05 why not give it\n\tto someone else?
  - neutral`*\thuh?^10\n*\twhy aren't they free?
  - side`*\ti've gotta pay bills somehow.
  topic3: What's a BASH weapon
  topic3lines:
  - neutral`*\toh yeah, that label on the\n\tbats that i found.
  - side`*\twell,^05 some weapons behave\n\tdifferently in battles,^05 and\n\thave different names for their\n\ttypes.
  - closed`*\tfor example,^05 susie's stick\n\tis a SLASH weapon,^05 and it does\n\tthe stuff that you already\n\tknow about.
  - rolleye`*\tand noelle's ring is an ICERING.^05\n*\tit doesn't hit very well,^05\n\tbut she can use her\n\tMAGIC in battle.
  - neutral`*\tand the bat is a BASH weapon.
  - closed`*\tthat basically means that it's\n\tusually pretty strong,^05 but aiming\n\tgradually speeds up.^05\n*\tmight be harder to use.
  - wink`*\tof course,^05 you won't need it\n\tif you're being nice to everyone.
  topic4: Red capped kid
  topic4lines:
  - neutral`*\tso i was wandering around\n\tthat twoson town,^05 and some\n\tweirdo came up to me and\n\tasked where my red cap was.
  - rolleye`*\tthen he tried to punch me\n\tand showed me a ruler before\n\the ran off.
  - wink`*\tneedless to say,^05 but that\n\twas weird.
  - side`*\toh,^05 right,^05 the red-capped\n\tkid.
  - neutral`*\ti guess it's some kid that's\n\ttryna save the world.
  - closed`*\tnot unlike you in some aspects.
  sellGreet: "What would \nyou like \nto sell?"
  sellSuccess: "Thanks for \nthat!"
  sellReject: "Changed your \nmind?"
  sellDeny: "We are \nnot accepting \nthat."
  backgroundSprites:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7da5a28dc7fdc5d47841484bb32dbfe7, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcfdbbbc8975180449f76d1fffe5c938, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5df9d88db45dea24083868967ae6462b, type: 2}
